{27}{The Panarii church is based on the teachings of Nasrudin, an elf who lived during the Age of Legends.  As head of the Elven Council, Nasrudin acted as a guide for all of the races, until the rise of Arronax and his evil followers.  Nasrudin waged war, and Arronax was defeated...the Panarii Church was founded some time after that.}{The Panarii church is based on the teachings of Nasrudin, an elf who lived during the Age of Legends.  As head of the Elven Council, Nasrudin acted as a guide for all of the races, until the rise of Arronax and his evil followers.  Nasrudin waged war, and Arronax was defeated...the Panarii Church was founded some time after that.}{}{}{}{}
