{47}{The Age of Legends was a time between 1500 and 2000 years ago, a time when magick was a much larger part of the world than it is today, before the mages left for Tulla.  A time of dragons and knights and kingdoms.  The time of the Elven Council...}{The Age of Legends was a time between 1500 and 2000 years ago, a time when magick was a much larger part of the world than it is today, before the mages left for Tulla.  A time of dragons and knights and kingdoms.  The time of the Elven Council...}{}{}{}{}
