{55}{The Elven Council was a group of elves and mages who oversaw the well-being of all of the races of Arcanum.  They were ruled by Nasrudin, a wise and powerful elf who was head of the council for 1000 years. }{The Elven Council was a group of elves and mages who oversaw the well-being of all of the races of Arcanum.  They were ruled by Nasrudin, a wise and powerful elf who was head of the council for 1000 years. }{}{}{}{}
