{63}{Nasrudin was the benevolent leader of the Elven Council.  For 1000 years he ruled all of Arcanum, and brought peace and prosperity to all of the races.  His teachings are recorded in the sacred Archeaon, and are the cornerstone of all Panarii beliefs.}{Nasrudin was the benevolent leader of the Elven Council.  For 1000 years he ruled all of Arcanum, and brought peace and prosperity to all of the races.  His teachings are recorded in the sacred Archeaon, and are the cornerstone of all Panarii beliefs.}{}{}{}{ru 2189}
