{98}{Arronax was an evil elf, who came into power during the Age of Legends.  He believed that only he and his followers were fit to rule, and decreed death to all of the races.  Nasrudin, in his mercy, came to our defense and, I quote from the Archaeon "...defeated Arronax, banishing him forever to the Void."}{Arronax was an evil elf, who came into power during the Age of Legends.  He believed that only he and his followers were fit to rule, and decreed death to all of the races.  Nasrudin, in his mercy, came to our defense and, I quote from the Archaeon "...defeated Arronax, banishing him forever to the Void."}{}{}{}{gf2344 1, ru 2188}
{99}{What do you mean, he was 'banished'?}{}{5}{}{110}{}
{100}{What is the Archaeon?}{}{5}{}{75}{}
{101}{A few more questions about the Panarii...}{}{5}{}{35}{}
{102}{A few more general questions...}{}{5}{}{14}{}
{104}{What 'banish' mean?}{}{-4}{}{110}{}
{105}{Arr-k-ke-on?  What that?}{}{-4}{}{75}{}
{106}{I ask more questions about Pa-na-r-r-ii?}{}{-4}{}{35}{}
{107}{Other questions...}{}{-4}{}{14}{}
{108}{E:}{}{1}{}{134}{}
{110}{We're not quite sure...banishments no longer happen.  We believe that it took powerful magick to do so, and once banished, that person never returned.  But the Archaeon speaks of it, and so we believe...}{We're not quite sure exactly what happens...no one is banished anymore.  We believe that it took powerful magick to do so, and once banished, that person never returned.  'The Void' is a term used to describe where one goes when banished, but no one knows if it was even a real place.  But the Archaeon speaks of it, and so we believe...}{}{}{}{}
{111}{Has anyone else ever been banished?}{}{5}{}{114}{}
{112}{Anybody else got b-a-n-n-ish-ed?}{}{-4}{}{114}{}
{114}{Yes...the Archaeon speaks of others who suffered the same fate as Arronax.  There are four who are listed by name--Gorgoth, Kraka-tur, Kerghan and the Bane of Kree.  They were all evil beings, but none were so evil as Arronax.  If you ever see the Archaeon, you can read more about them...}{Yes...the Archaeon speaks of others who suffered the same fate as Arronax.  There are four who are listed by name--Gorgoth, Kraka-tur, Kerghan and the Bane of Kree.  They were all evil beings, but none were so evil as Arronax.  If you ever see the Archaeon, you can read more about them...}{}{}{}{}
{115}{What is the Archaeon?}{}{5}{}{75}{}
