{122}{E:}{}{1}{}{134}{}
{124}{Yes...it is called the Prophecy of the Living One.  It is written in the Archaeon that one day both Nasrudin and Arronax will return to Arcanum and fight the final battle...}{Yes...it is called the Prophecy of the Living One.  It is written in the Archaeon that one day both Nasrudin and Arronax will return to Arcanum and fight the final battle...}{}{}{}{gf2344 1, gf2004 1}
