{131}{Yes...he's been dead for a long time.  The literal meaning of the prophecy is unknown...many believe that they will both be reincarnated, or that the prophecy is a metaphor for something more contemporary.  The truth is, we just don't know...}{Yes...he's been dead for a long time.  The literal meaning of the prophecy is unknown...many believe that they will both be reincarnated, or that the prophecy is a metaphor for something more contemporary.  The truth is, we just don't know...}{}{}{}{}
